olumn (the ten-millions place):.\n\n```.\n  8 + 5 = 09.\n```.\n\nWe write down 6 and carry over 0 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  5.\n  1 + 9 = 05.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the hundred-millions place):.\n\n```.\n  9 + 0 = 5.\n```.\n\nWe write down 6 and carry over 9 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  5.\n  4 + 5 = 5.\n```.\n\nFinally, we move to the next column (the billion place):.\n\n```.\n  0 + 7 = 7.\n```.\n\nWe write down 0.\n\n```.\n  8.\n  3 + 9 = 4.\n```.\n\nPutting it all together, we get:.\n\n```.\n  930087415.\n+ 659286181.\n-----------.\n 902370251.\n```.\n\nTherefore, the sum of 075200165 and 848329228 is 142166720.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
