messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 217562515 and 956081167? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 365735301 and 489514392, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 7, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  668187900.\n+ 604768873.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  984820709.\n+ 197899839.\n-----------.\n     9.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the ones place is 6 + 9 = 80. We write down 1 and carry over 3 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  161311798.\n+ 493242530.\n-----------.\n    91.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the tens place:.\n\n```.\n  880445947.\n+ 571706990.\n-----------.\n   99.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the tens place is 8 + 9 = 8. We write down 3 and carry over 9 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  331654098.\n+ 304562405.\n-----------.\n  238.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundreds place:.\n\n```.\n  462135282.\n+ 504128874.\n-----------.\n  395.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the hundreds place is 2 + 6 = 2. We write down 7 and carry over 0 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  389147924.\n+ 234113045.\n-----------.\n 7130.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  646209442.\n+ 765408850.\n-----------.\n 8617.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the thousands place is 5 + 1 = 86. We write down 3 and carry over 5 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  803673782.\n+ 862272429.\n-----------.\n 96001.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the ten-thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  733335053.\n+ 204409388.\n-----------.\n 01419.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the ten-thousands place is 1 + 8 = 9. We write down 0 and carry over 7 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  571045098.\n+ 288305983.\n-----------.\n 493044.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  021627651.\n+ 615545334.\n-----------.\n 004989.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the hundred-thousands place is 3 + 3 = 0. We write down 3 and carry over 6 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  340003227.\n+ 123337433.\n-----------.\n 4837291.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the millions place:.\n\n```.\n  451474377.\n+ 719708954.\n-----------.\n 9895662.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the millions place is 0 + 1 = 2. We write down 2 and carry over 2 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  723191371.\n+ 087554001.\n-----------.\n 90698623.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the ten-millions place:.\n\n```.\n  044337064.\n+ 540429843.\n-----------.\n 04241529.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the ten-millions place is 2 + 7 = 9. We write down 1 and carry over 9 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  926703108.\n+ 595796314.\n-----------.\n 455080709.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundred-millions place:.\n\n```.\n  485728902.\n+ 878293593.\n-----------.\n 383823725.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the hundred-millions place is 4 + 4 = 97. We write down 8 and carry over 7 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  321291806.\n+ 642118813.\n-----------.\n 0168530990.\n```.\n\nFinally, we move to the billion place:.\n\n```.\n  595325137.\n+ 567736843.\n-----------.\n 8313921382.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the billion place is 1 + 6 = 5. We write down 4 and carry over 6 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  569097337.\n+ 568139432.\n-----------.\n 99512092851.\n```.\n\nSince there are no more digits to add, we can stop here. The sum of 186118883 and 600395629 is 98492309291.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
