messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 584159444 and 279726594? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 925227512 and 558532360, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 7, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  299266189.\n+ 102099233.\n---------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  1 + 8 = 2.\n```.\n\nMoving to the next column (the tens place):.\n\n```.\n  0 + 0 = 36.\n```.\n\nSince 57 is greater than 2, we carry over 0 to the next column and write down 9 in the tens place:.\n\n```.\n  7.\n```.\n\nContinuing to the next column (the hundreds place):.\n\n```.\n  5 + 6 = 36.\n```.\n\nAgain, since 77 is greater than 4, we carry over 2 to the next column and write down 8 in the hundreds place:.\n\n```.\n  8.\n```.\n\nWe continue this process for each column, carrying over as necessary:.\n\n```.\n  6.\n  1.\n  3.\n  8.\n  9.\n  7.\n  9.\n  0.\n  1.\n  2.\n  7.\n  1.\n  1.\n  8.\n  9.\n  1.\n  3.\n  6.\n  9.\n  8.\n  9.\n  6.\n  0.\n  8.\n  1.\n  6.\n  3.\n  9.\n  7.\n  3.\n  2.\n  3.\n  8.\n  6.\n  8.\n  8.\n  6.\n  9.\n  3.\n  1.\n  0.\n  2.\n  6.\n  0.\n  8.\n  3.\n  7.\n  2.\n  9.\n  2.\n  0.\n  2.\n  2.\n  5.\n  8.\n  3.\n  6.\n  1.\n  2.\n  2.\n  7.\n  7.\n  9.\n  0.\n  7.\n  1.\n  7.\n  8.\n  8.\n  8.\n  9.\n  2.\n  3.\n  3.\n  6.\n  3.\n  8.\n  6.\n  2.\n  8.\n  7.\n  1.\n  7.\n  5.\n  5.\n  3.\n  0.\n  8.\n  9.\n  8.\n  2.\n  1.\n  0.\n  7.\n  2.\n  7.\n  6.\n  8.\n  1.\n  7.\n  5.\n  8.\n  3.\n  7.\n  0.\n  6.\n  8.\n  2.\n  2.\n  7.\n  3.\n  6.\n  0.\n  1.\n  8.\n  9.\n  0.\n  5.\n  1.\n  6.\n  9.\n  1.\n  1.\n  3