messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 363171983 and 336390092? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 812589859 and 012473133, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 2, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  442448722.\n+ 420088828.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  670385271.\n+ 208136486.\n-----------.\n     8.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the ones place is 5 + 8 = 1, so we write 9 in the ones place of the sum.\n\nNext, we move to the tens place:.\n\n```.\n  792542791.\n+ 780817931.\n-----------.\n    7.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the tens place is 0 + 7 = 31, so we write 4 in the tens place of the sum and carry over 4 to the hundreds place.\n\nNext, we move to the hundreds place:.\n\n```.\n  748219728.\n+ 905754625.\n-----------.\n   84.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the hundreds place is 6 + 1 + 8 = 98, so we write 6 in the hundreds place of the sum and carry over 5 to the thousands place.\n\nNext, we move to the thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  747003147.\n+ 579903943.\n-----------.\n  129.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the thousands place is 5 + 4 + 4 = 51, so we write 0 in the thousands place of the sum and carry over 8 to the ten-thousands place.\n\nNext, we move to the ten-thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  548630247.\n+ 578106867.\n-----------.\n  2160.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the ten-thousands place is 7 + 9 + 0 = 2, so we write 2 in the ten-thousands place of the sum and carry over 6 to the hundred-thousands place.\n\nNext, we move to the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  571648310.\n+ 542731385.\n-----------.\n 616296.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the hundred-thousands place is 4 + 7 + 2 = 1, so we write 9 in the hundred-thousands place of the sum.\n\nNext, we move to the millions place:.\n\n```.\n  888382291.\n+ 571662946.\n-----------.\n51358246.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the millions place is 2 + 1 = 68, so we write 9 in the millions place of the sum and carry over 0 to the ten-millions place.\n\nNext, we move to the ten-millions place:.\n\n```.\n  844416230.\n+ 644014326.\n-----------.\n2337232209.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the ten-millions place is 0 + 8 + 8 = 6, so we write 5 in the ten-millions place of the sum.\n\nFinally, we move to the hundred-millions place:.\n\n```.\n  127940266.\n+ 158622147.\n-----------.\n984434196622.\n```.\n\nThe sum of the digits in the hundred-millions place is 0 + 4 = 1, so we write 7 in the hundred-millions place of the sum.\n\nTherefore, the sum of 656304390 and 054466618 is 612769241667.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
