messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 727560084 and 294115331? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 119685461 and 056860426, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 2, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  913499852.\n+ 539983097.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 2.\n-----.\n  7.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the tens place):.\n\n```.\n  2.\n+ 5.\n-----.\n  6.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the hundreds place):.\n\n```.\n  6.\n+ 9.\n-----.\n  2.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the thousands place):.\n\n```.\n  3.\n+ 0.\n-----.\n  6.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the ten-thousands place):.\n\n```.\n  8.\n+ 9.\n-----.\n  1.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the hundred-thousands place):.\n\n```.\n  3.\n+ 2.\n-----.\n  1.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the millions place):.\n\n```.\n  5.\n+ 1.\n-----.\n  8.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the ten-millions place):.\n\n```.\n  5.\n+ 4.\n-----.\n  7.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the hundred-millions place):.\n\n```.\n  6.\n+ 0.\n-----.\n  1.\n```.\n\nFinally, we move to the next column (the billion place):.\n\n```.\n  2.\n+ 8.\n-----.\n  5.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 675348600 and 063067156 is 9598960257.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
