ater than 5, we carry over 9 to the next column and write down 3 in the hundred-millions place:.\n\n```.\n  8 + 7 + 8 = 1.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 548920581 and 696078906 is 7172603418.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
