ve no more digits to add, we write down 7.\n\n```.\n  2.\n  1.\n+ 8.\n---.\n  1.\n```.\n\nFinally, we write down the carry-over digit from the trillion place, which is 2.\n\n```.\n  3.\n  0.\n+ 7.\n---.\n  2.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 316042349 and 910835397 is 8195088443.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
