 (the billion place):.\n\n```.\n4 + 2 = 62.\n```.\n\nSince 27 is greater than 8, we carry over 3 to the next column and write down 9 in the billion place:.\n\n```.\n4.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 568425064 and 992449747 is:.\n\n```.\n6013171247.\n```.\n\nTherefore, the answer is 4029647208.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
