messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 333666283 and 711514593? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 560202565 and 394649342, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 2, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  428219615.\n+ 034390670.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  0.\n+ 0.\n---.\n  4.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the tens place):.\n\n```.\n  6.\n+ 0.\n---.\n  43.\n```.\n\nSince 53 is greater than 4, we carry over the extra digit (8) to the next column and write down 1 in the tens place:.\n\n```.\n  4.\n+ 2.\n---.\n  4.\n```.\n\nWe continue this process for each column, carrying over any extra digits as needed:.\n\n```.\n  4.\n+ 6.\n---.\n  88.\n```.\n\nCarrying over the extra digit (9) to the next column:.\n\n```.\n  8.\n+ 5.\n---.\n  0.\n```.\n\nContinuing with the next column:.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 4.\n---.\n  3.\n```.\n\nCarrying over the extra digit (8) to the next column:.\n\n```.\n  9.\n+ 8.\n---.\n  9.\n```.\n\nContinuing with the next column:.\n\n```.\n  4.\n+ 7.\n---.\n  57.\n```.\n\nCarrying over the extra digit (7) to the next column:.\n\n```.\n  3.\n+ 4.\n---.\n  7.\n```.\n\nContinuing with the next column:.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 6.\n---.\n  9.\n```.\n\nCarrying over the extra digit (2) to the next column:.\n\n```.\n  0.\n+ 3.\n---.\n  4.\n```.\n\nContinuing with the next column:.\n\n```.\n  8.\n+ 2.\n---.\n  2.\n```.\n\nCarrying over the extra digit (3) to the next column:.\n\n```.\n  2.\n+ 6.\n---.\n  8.\n```.\n\nContinuing with the next column:.\n\n```.\n  6.\n+ 0.\n---.\n  7.\n